{%- comment -%}
  iPhone Duo launch page: the Konimbo campaign page (joymobile.konimbo.co.il/user_files/299968),
  ported as is, without iPhone 18. Used by templates/page.iphone-duo.json on layout/landing.liquid,
  which has no store header or footer. Like the original, the script below renders the whole page.
  - The same file serves both stores (themes joymobile and joymobile-merkaz): STORE is "eilat" on the
    Eilat shop and "national" elsewhere, and STORE_COPY holds the lines that differ (Eilat: no VAT,
    pickup at the Eilat branches; national: VAT included, home delivery, no pickup).
  - Images: JOY's are theme assets (iphone-duo-*.webp); Apple's product images stay hotlinked from apple.com.
  - Leads go to the same Google Apps Script as the original page. That receiver accepts only the
    original page's source ("iphone18-launch-page") and privacy URL (the Konimbo contract page), so
    both are sent unchanged and the consent checkbox links to that same policy.
  - Privacy and terms links: the Hebrew pages (handles privacy, terms) when they exist, else Shopify's
    policy pages, like the footer and contact form of the theme.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign store = 'national'
  if shop.permanent_domain == 'x511g0-rj.myshopify.com'
    assign store = 'eilat'
  endif
  assign privacy_url = pages['privacy'].url | default: shop.privacy_policy.url | default: '/policies/privacy-policy'
  assign terms_url = pages['terms'].url | default: shop.terms_of_service.url | default: '/policies/terms-of-service'
-%}
